      <title>Women’s Tennis Rallies in Singles as Bovio, Bobrovnikova Secure Victory over MTSU</title>
      <link>https://lipscombsports.com/news/2026/2/1/womens-tennis-womens-tennis-rallies-in-singles-as-bovio-bobrovnikova-secure-victory-over-mtsu.aspx</link>
      <description>MURFREESBORO, Tenn. – After losing the doubles point and seeing themselves down 3-2 late in singles, the Lipscomb University Women's Tennis team rallied late thanks to the hands of Serafima Bobrovnikova and Martina Bovio to defeat Middle Tennessee State University, 4-3, Sunday afternoon from the Adams Tennis Center.</description>
